pub const PROJECT_APPENDICES_PLAIN_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION: &str = "This section of the Graduation Project Report provides additional resources that complement the main content. Each appendix is labeled with descriptive titles for easy reference.\n\n**User Manual**\n\n- **Purpose:** Offer a comprehensive guide for system installation, usage, and navigation.\n- **Details:** Provide step-by-step instructions, include screenshots, and thoroughly explain all features and functions.\n- **Target Audience:** Tailor language and detail to match the users' technical expertise.\n\n**Code Listing**\n\n- **Purpose:** Supply the complete source code for reference and potential future development.\n- **Details:** Organize the code with clear comments and proper formatting.\n- **Instructions:** Ensure the code is well-documented and complies with coding standards.\n\n**Testing Results**\n\n- **Purpose:** Deliver a detailed report on testing outcomes, including test cases, inputs, expected outputs, and actual results.\n- **Details:** Present results clearly and systematically, emphasizing key findings or issues.\n- **Evaluation:** Analyze how test results affect the system's quality and reliability.\n\n**Additional Appendices**\n\n- **Purpose:** Provide other supporting materials like datasets, images, diagrams, or research papers.\n- **Details:** Ensure materials are relevant, well-organized, and properly cited.\n\nEach appendix should have a clear label and a brief introduction explaining its purpose and content. Present all materials professionally and accessibly.";
